      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEASIDE LADY (1) is going well having recorded two wins and two minor placings from the past four starts. Drew wide last start and covered ground early before working to the front and going on to score by 3 metres at this circuit and distance. Likely to get the favours from the inside draw so could take this step up. IM ALL BUSINESS (11) drew wide and worked but was too good at this venue two back before racing parked and sticking on for second at his latest appearance, beaten 2.7 metres. Hard to know where he gets to from this draw but he is going well. KETO NZ (6) will be hitting peak fitness now and put the writing on the wall when he showed improvement and finished runner-up from this barrier last start. ROCKIN GEMMA (8) has placed in both starts off a spell and races well third up so should be close to her peak.",
